        "TileImage": "$($repository c90c8b30-19cd-4c87-a185-f40d235243e0).Image",
        "Description": "Welcome back to Marrakesh, 47.\r\rYour target is M Sofranov, lead geo-engineer for the covert excavation firm &quot;Forgotten Flood&quot;. He has reactivated an ancient seismic resonator beneath the ruins of Nan Madol. The agent who was monitoring him was found dead. He had `drowned´.  Sofranov is accused of murdering the agent to conceal his illigal plans for the manipulation of tectonic plates. His beanie and his t-shirt are his cleanroom clothing and he always wear this. Eliminate him.\r\rGood Luck 47.",
